=== E4.1: Clipped Synapses (2/pi capacity factor) & Unidirectional Dilution (1/sqrt(2) SNR, p. 2557) ===
  Unclipped SNR:      3.1627 (theoretical sqrt((N-1)/(n-1)) = 3.1464)
  Clipped (+-1) SNR:  2.5193 -> ratio Clipped/Unclipped = 0.7966 (theoretical sqrt(2/pi) = 0.7979)
  Unidirectional SNR: 2.1697 -> ratio Unidir/Unclipped  = 0.6860 (theoretical 1/sqrt(2)  = 0.7071, with degree var sqrt(10/10.5)/sqrt(2) = 0.6901)

=== E4.2: Bounded Saturating Synapses T_ij in {-3..+3} Palimpsest Forgetting (N=100, 40 sequential memories, p. 2557) ===
  Unclipped T_ij (40 memories in N=100, overloaded): Old(#1..#5) bit acc =  74.0% | Recent(#36..#40) =  74.2%
  Saturating T_ij in [-3, +3] (palimpsest, p. 2557): Old(#1..#5) bit acc =  55.8% | Recent(#38..#40) =  99.8%

